{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40717","headline":"送包处士 · 李洞","name":"送包处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋思枕月卧潇湘，寄宿慈恩竹里房。\n性急却於棊上慢，身闲未免药中忙。\n休抛手网惊龙睡，曾挂头巾拂鸟行。\n闻说石门君旧隐，寒峰溅瀑坏书堂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40717.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40717","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}